        "name": "Genereer random kleurenvolgorde",
        "func": "let alleKleuren = [\"ROOD\", \"BLAUW\", \"GROEN\", \"GEEL\"];\nlet kleurenCode = [\"?\", \"?\", \"?\", \"?\"];\n\nfor (let index = 0; index < 4; index++) {\n    let randIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * alleKleuren.length);\n    kleurenCode[index] = alleKleuren[randIndex];\n    alleKleuren.splice(randIndex, 1);\n}\n\nglobal.set(\"kleurcode\", kleurenCode);\nglobal.set(\"win\", false);\nmsg.payload = kleurenCode;\nreturn msg;",
